---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Arizona Pigeon Proofing, Tucson AZ"
  description="Arizona Pigeon Proofing connects Tucson-area homeowners with local, licensed, insured crews for solar panel bird proofing and cleaning."
  pageData={{ content_group: "about" }}
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h1>Local crews, one call.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Arizona Pigeon Proofing connects Tucson-area homeowners with local, licensed, insured crews for solar panel bird proofing and cleaning — one call instead of chasing down separate contractors.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <p>We handle two things, and only two things: pigeon proofing (bird mesh installed around solar arrays) and solar panel cleaning. You tell us your city and what you're seeing, and we match you with a local, licensed, insured crew that handles both — often in the same visit — instead of you having to find, vet, and schedule a contractor yourself.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="alt">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <h2>Why this matters here</h2>
      <p>Tucson has one of the highest rates of rooftop solar adoption in Arizona, and the same conditions that make solar worth having — intense sun, a raised, tilted panel gap — also create the exact shaded, sheltered microclimate pigeons look for, plus heavy monsoon dust that cuts into panel output twice a year. Bird proofing and cleaning aren't optional extras here; they're what keeps a solar investment actually performing.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p>Request a free quote with your city and what you're seeing. A local crew follows up within 24–48 hours, gives you a real price based on your specific panels and roof access (not a flat per-panel rate), and gets the work scheduled. Every job is done by a licensed, insured crew.</p>
      <p>We're live in Tucson Metro today — <a href="/locations/tucson-metro/">see all the cities we cover</a> — with Phoenix Metro pages built and waiting on a confirmed local crew.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #0d1620 0%, #132430 55%, #173247 100%); color: #f2f5f1; }
  .page-hero .wrap { padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 4rem; }
  .page-hero .eyebrow { color: #7fd1d6; }
  .page-hero h1 { font-size: 2.3rem; margin: 0.6rem 0 0.9rem; color: #fbfbf7; }
  .page-hero .lede { font-size: 1.05rem; color: #c9d4d0; max-width: 52ch; margin: 0; }
  .wrap.narrow { max-width: 760px; }
  section.alt { background: var(--surface-2); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.7rem; }
</style>
